
@api = http://localhost:3000

### List events
GET {{api}}/events?category=workshop

### List all events
GET {{api}}/events

### Search (look for ILIKE in the API terminal when query logging is on)
GET {{api}}/events?search=lab

### One event
GET {{api}}/events/2

### Create an event
POST {{api}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Pitch Night",
  "category": "social",
  "startsAt": "2026-12-01T18:00:00.000Z",
  "location": "Student Hall",
  "capacity": 50
}

### Invalid: expect 400 with one message per problem
POST {{api}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Hi", "capacity": 0, "booked": 99 }

### Update an event (change 7 to the id your create returned)
PATCH {{api}}/events/7
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Pitch Night (updated)" }

### Get event 7 after update
GET {{api}}/events/7

### Delete an event (change 7 to your id)
DELETE {{api}}/events/7

### Get event 7 after delete: expect 404
GET {{api}}/events/7

### Update missing event: expect 404
PATCH {{api}}/events/9999
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Nope" }

### Delete missing event: expect 404
DELETE {{api}}/events/9999

### Book 2 seats (Part C)
POST {{api}}/events/2/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Dara", "email": "dara@example.com", "seats": 2 }

### Too many seats: expect 409 (Part C)
POST {{api}}/events/2/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Dara", "email": "dara@example.com", "seats": 4 }

### Cancel booking 1 (Part C)
DELETE {{api}}/bookings/1
